# CQRS publish boundary (Passive Income Idea)

```text
Worker (generate / run-daily) = computes Idea + writes public artifacts
Next.js shell                 = reads artifacts and renders
React                         = presents fields; does not decide
```

Hard project rule. Do not move Idea research, scoring, probing, or PDF generation into request handlers or the browser.

## Allowed on the web app

- Read `public/data/*.json` and serve `public/reports/*.pdf`
- Merge a precomputed `locales[lang]` pack for display
- Chrome i18n, theme, navigation, legal pages

## Forbidden on the request path

- Re-score / pick Ideas, Jaccard continuity, SQLite memory writes
- Live URL probing or OpenAI polish
- Inventing or “healing” income bands, evidence, or fit scores
- Regenerating PDF or sending Resend email from Next routes
- Hiding a missed worker run by computing a fresh Idea in Vercel

## New field workflow

1. Worker snapshot + publish JSON/PDF  
2. Then UI renders the new field  

If the UI needs a number or claim, add it in the worker first.

See `docs/adr/003-cqrs-publish-boundary.md`.
